OL,1,W5j 5Q#7!wsj#%uzj#57kj  7kjc1uz
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q % -,*,%%** %-.*,$-.*,%,. (,
OL,3,AAustralia considers criminal penalties
OL,4,Afor rogue AI in wake of OpenAI hack
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn Tuesday, he released the 18
OL,7,Frecommendations made after a "rapid
OL,8,Freview" into the breaches including new
OL,9,Fsafety and security standards for AI
OL,10,Fcompanies such as mandatory reporting
OL,11,Fof hacks.
OL,13,FAI brings opportunities, he said, but
OL,14,FAustralia must prepare for the "new
OL,15,Frisks" from this "rapidly advancing
OL,16,Ftechnology".
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/19
